      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَحْفَاحٌ</span></b>  A man (L) <i>having a hoarse, harsh,</i> or
<i>gruff, voice.</i> (L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And A man <i>speaking,</i>
or <i>talking:</i> or <i>talkative.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَحْفَاحُ</span>
is the name of <i>A river in Paradise.</i> (S, K.)

